  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 3905.01 Reciprocity. Any person who has received training in another jurisdiction and wishes to obtain reciprocity certification shall comply with the provisions of Fire 405.\n\nSource. #6148, eff 12-22-95; ss by #7974, eff 10-20-03, EXPIRED: 10-20-11\n\nNew. #10014, eff 10-25-11 (from Saf-C 3904.01); ss by #12966, eff 12-31-19\n\nAPPENDIX 1\n\nAPPENDIX 2\n\nRule | Title | Obtain at:\n\nSaf-C 3904.01(a)(4) | “NFPA 1: Fire Code Handbook” | https://catalog.nfpa.org/NFPA-1-Fire-Code-P1593.aspx Cost: $182.00",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c3900.html"
